`.panel`'s `order`/`margin-left:auto` are no-ops because its parent `.d-header` is not a flex container, and the working `float: right` was removed

Trigger: Header renders with `.panel` (containing login/sign-up buttons and header icons) as a direct child of `.d-header`, which is NOT a flex container (only its sibling `.contents` got `@include flexbox();` in this same patch); the previous `float: right;` rule on `.panel` was deleted in this hunk.

