Location: src/sentry/testutils/factories.py:347-357 (RIGHT)

_set_sample_rate_from_error_sampling silently swallows all exceptions

Trigger: A test passes malformed data into store_event/create-event helpers, e.g. contexts set to None or a non-numeric client_sample_rate value

Impact: Errors such as AttributeError (when contexts is None) or ValueError (non-numeric client_sample_rate) are silently discarded, so sample_rate is silently omitted and the test proceeds with unexpected data instead of failing loudly, masking real fixture bugs

